cpfour′ ∶ (→ (𝔏 ℕ) ℕ)
cpfour′ bs ≔ (⊞ (⊠ (⊞ (⊠ (⊞ (⊠ (dif′ (hd bs) 10001110100000000) 11101000000000000) (dif′ (nth bs 1) 11100000000000000)) 11101000000000000) (dif′ (nth bs 1100) 11100000000000000)) 11101000000000000) (dif′ (nth bs 1101) 11100000000000000))
